WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:01.560
[APPLAUSE]

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:05.250
These are the nominees for
Best Animated Feature Film.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.610
I just had on a loop in my
head, going through that speech

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.710
so that I didn't
mess it up because I

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.870
felt a real responsibility
in the event that we did win.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:19.020
Big Hero 6.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:23.310
I remember the walk down because
as I was walking from the seat

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.300
to the stage, in my mind I
could hear all my friends

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.030
from around the world cheering.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.850
I kind of blanked out a little
bit and kind of teleported--

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:33.360
Wow.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.960
--to the bottom of the stairs.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.220
And when I came to, I
thought about my mom

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:44.700
because sorry, sorry,
she loves the Oscars.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.040
And I remember watching it
with her when I was young.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.332
And it was special to me
because it was special to her.

00:00:49.332 --> 00:00:51.960
Congratulations to all
our fellow nominees.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:56.040
I remember trying not to focus
because if I ever for a moment

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.380
would stop and see
George Clooney,

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.398
I would probably mess
up my speech in my head.

00:01:00.398 --> 00:01:01.440
So I was just trying to--

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.280
Because he's looking
right at you.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:02.780
Yeah.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.820
At the end, I saw the
mic was available.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.610
And I had to jump
in with my wife.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:09.838
Love you, Mary.

00:01:09.838 --> 00:01:11.880
There's all the parties,
having such a good time.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:12.660
It's such a good vibe.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:13.560
You don't want to leave.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.620
And then next thing you
know, it's like hey,

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:15.420
we've got to get to work.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:15.660
Yeah.

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:16.080
We got to--

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:17.955
--because we've got the
whole crew assembled.

00:01:17.955 --> 00:01:19.950
It was a late night.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:21.770
Early morning.

